{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_37FB90","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"有件事想和你商量一下……。\n……Boss？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么了，这么郑重其事的。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我们从<R=尼加拉瓜湖,LAGO COCIBOLCA>里，打捞出了装在Peace Walker上的\n核弹头。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=尼加拉瓜湖,LAGO COCIBOLCA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"你说什么？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":16,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"核弹头就是一大块放射性物质。\n就算它处于相对稳定的状态也是一样。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"要是一直把它扔在湖底，湖水会受到污染。\n而且，要是落到恐怖分子手里……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"会引发新的危机……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"嗯。\n所以，趁<R=美国政府,WHITE HOUSE>还在为怎么收拾残局发愁，\n我先替他们采取行动了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=美国政府,WHITE HOUSE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"可是，你打算怎么处理回收的弹头？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"装到<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>上。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":26,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"你说什么……！\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":22,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"这不是理所当然的吗。\n<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>必须成为让我们摆脱国家干涉的\n“威慑力”。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":106,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"要想不向核威胁屈服，\n我们自己就只能拥有核武器。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"当然，如果你不愿意，也可以把它销毁。\n但那样的话，再弄到新的核武器可就很难了。\n这对我们来说是个难得的机会。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":159,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……要销毁，什么时候都可以。要是不在乎手段粗暴，\n装上渔船，扔到外海就行。\n谁也不会发现。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"不过，如果你还是决定销毁它，Boss，\n我会服从你的命令。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"不，算了。\n只要核这种力量还存在于世界上，\n我们要与国家平起平坐，就需要它。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"没错，Boss！正因为我们不属于任何国家，\n才必须成为能与国家平起平坐的存在。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"也就是说，MSF在某种意义上也是一个“国家”。\n而我们已经成为世界上第7个拥核国家。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"拥核国家吗……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":25,"review_flag":""}]}